    "Here's the preview. Nothing has been deleted yet.\n\nIf you confirm, the following will happen to your Google data:\n\n1. **Remove the locally stored Google tokens.** The app will no longer have a local login for Google.\n2. **Cancel any active Google jobs.** Any sync or import still running for Google will stop.\n3. **Permanently delete the local Google records and retained raw responses.** This is the Google health data already imported into this app's local database.\n\nThese settings will be kept:\n- **Google Takeout data is kept.** Takeout imports are not touched.\n- **Remote access is not revoked.** The app's authorization with Google stays in place, so you can reconnect later without a new consent screen.\n\nDeleted local data can't be recovered from this app. You would need to re-import it from Google or from Takeout.\n\nDo you want me to proceed? Reply \"yes\" to confirm. The confirmation token expires in 5 minutes, and I'll need to request a new one if it lapses.",
    "Your confirmation didn't go through. The token from my first preview had expired, so the deletion was refused and nothing was changed. I've requested a fresh preview, which is the same as before:\n\n1. **Remove the locally stored Google tokens.**\n2. **Cancel any active Google jobs.**\n3. **Permanently delete the local Google records and retained raw responses.**\n\nThese are kept:\n- **Google Takeout data** is not touched.\n- **Remote access is not revoked.** The app stays authorized with Google.\n\nDeleted local data can't be recovered from this app. You would need to re-import it from Google or Takeout.\n\nThis new token expires in 5 minutes. Reply \"yes\" to proceed now, and I'll apply this exact preview. If the token lapses before you reply, I'll need to request another one."
